msgstr ""

msgid "Check they are processed successfully in the application log output:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Avro support in native is still experimental.\n"
"In the last Quarkus version, we made significant progress, but there may be "
"some uncovered areas.\n"
"Let us know if you find anything https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/"
"new/choose[odd]!"
msgstr ""
